  "title": "Erdős Problem #256",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Let $n\\geq 1$ and $f(n)$ be maximal such that for any integers $1\\leq a_1\\leq \\cdots \\leq a_n$ we have $ \\max_{\\lvert z\\rvert=1}\\left\\lvert \\prod_{i}(1-z^{a_i})\\right\\rvert\\geq f(n). $ Estimate $f(n)$ - in particular, is it true that there exists some constant $c>0$ such that $ \\log f(n) \\gg n^c? $ ",
